<title>USA: Zila suit against Colgate ends.</title>
<headline>Zila suit against Colgate ends.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zila Inc said Wednesday its patent lawsuit against Colgate-Palmolive Co had ended. It gave no details, and terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Zila filed the suit in 1994 alleging infringement of its patent on Zilactin medicated gel for mouthsores.</p>
<p>&quot;The conclusion of this suit signifies the end of a three-year effort, on which Zila has spent more than a million dollars in legal fees and related costs, plus countless hours of management's time. We are pleased to see the end of this financial drain on the company's resources,&quot; said Joseph Hines, Zila president.</p>
</text>
